# Canonical public origin, no trailing slash.
#
# Social crawlers require absolute URLs, so og:/twitter: tags can't use relative
# paths. Rather than hardcode a host in four meta tags, index.html substitutes
# %VITE_SITE_URL% at build time — pointing a custom domain at this project is a
# one-line change here.
#
# Not a secret; committed on purpose. Override per-deploy with an environment
# variable of the same name (Vercel: Project Settings → Environment Variables).
VITE_SITE_URL=https://berkeley-swim.vercel.app
